# DsCommentBubble docs snippets

## Initial

### Show code
<DsCommentBubble
  onActionRequiredChange={() => {}}
  onClose={() => {}}
  onSend={() => {}}
  onValueChange={() => {}}
  referenceTag="Resource allocation"
  value=""
/>

### MCP manifest
const Initial = () => <DsCommentBubble
    referenceTag="Resource allocation"
    onSend={fn()}
    onClose={fn()}
    onValueChange={fn()}
    onActionRequiredChange={fn()}
    value="" />;

